title: Hermes_test
---
<<Fade "#000000" 1 0 0.4>>
<<wait 0.1>>
<<PlayMusic Hermes_Theme>>
<<Scene new_dining_area>>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "left" "bottom" #674ea7>>

<<Act "Hermes" "Hermes 3_4" "right" "bottom" #023020>>
Aelius: Hey, welcome in.
Hermes: Hi there, can I get a—

Hermes: Wait, you're new here.
Aelius: Yes, my name's Aelius, I'm the new cook. Hestia hired me- first day, and all that.
Hermes: Well hello then, Aelius. I'm Hermes.
Hermes: But I assume you already guessed that.
-> It's nice to meet you. (deference)
    //Aelius: It's nice to meet you.
    <<AddHermesAffinity 1>>
    Hermes: It's nice to meet ya too! Good seeing a new face around here- it's been <i>so</i> long.
-> I had my suspicions. (humorous)
    //Aelius: I had my suspicions.
    <<AddHermesAffinity 2>>
    Hermes: (Sarcastic) <i>Very</i> clever of you.
    Hermes: I'm in a hurry, kid — not much time to chat. Could you whip me up a Lotus Parfait? Quickly, please.
    Aelius: You got it. I'll do my best.
-> Obviously. (aggressive)
    //Aelius: Obviously.
    <<AddHermesAffinity 1>>
    Hermes: Ha! I <i>do</i> look the part, don't I?

Hermes: [Neutral] Well, hate to say it, but I'm in a hurry kid. Not much time to stay and chat. Could you whip me up some <b>Nectar</b>? Quickly, please.
Aelius: [Neutral] You got it, I'll do my best.


<<StopMuzic 0.35>>
<<HideAll>>
<<Fade "#000000" 0 1 0.35>>
<<wait 0.4>>
<<AddHermesAffinity 2>>
<<StartCooking "Nectar">>
===

title: Hermes_test_SuccessPlayful
