<<wait 0.1>>
<<Scene "lounge bg draft 3">>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "left" "bottom" #674ea7>>
<<PlayMusic Hermes_Theme>>
Aelius: Got your Nectar ready as fast as I could.
Aelius: <i>(Hopefully this goes better than the other two…)</i>
Aelius: <i>*(Or at least better than Zeus *sigh*)*</i>
Aelius: Hope you like it.

<<Act "Hermes" "Hermes 3_4" "right" "bottom" #023020>>
<<AddHermesAffinity 2>>

Hermes: Now isn't that cute! I almost feel bad drinking it.
Hermes: Almost.
<<jump Hermes_Day1_after_cooking>>

