title: Hermes_Day1_after_cooking
---
Hermes: Thanks, Aelius. Looks great!
Hermes: Only wish I had time to sit and enjoy it.
Hermes: But, y'know duty calls. Messages to deliver, cattle to steal. You get the jist.

Aelius: … Yeah
Hermes: You're lookin' a litte down in the dumps. Rough first day?

-> Yeah, but you don't have to worry about it... (deference)
    //Aelius: It is, but you don't have to worry about it..
    <<AddHermesAffinity 1>>
    Hermes: Don't sweat it.
-> You could say that. (humorous)
    Hermes: Aha, I knew I'd be spot on.
    <<AddHermesAffinity 2>>
-> It's none of your business.
    //Aelius: It's none of your business.
    Hermes: Meh, figured I might as well ask.
    Aelius: It's fine, <i>I'm</i> fine.

Hermes: Let me guess, Zeus stopped in, eh?
Aelius: How'd you know?
Hermes: Call it <i>godly</i> intuition. 
Hermes: But honestly, it's easy to tell. He's very good at ruffling newcomers' feathers.
Aelius: I just... he didn't seem to want me here. I cooked his food to perfection.
Hermes: Aelius, listen up. People like Zeus are just some honor and glory loving dudes.
Hermes: Just ignore him. Do your best. Show him you're up to snuff.
Aelius: It's not that easy-
Hermes: I really gotta be going. Can't be late on these messages.
Hermes: I'll see you around!
<<Hide "Hermes">>
<<wait 0.2>>
Aelius: Well, that was... better, I guess.



<<set $hermes_day1_done = true>>
<<StopMuzic 0.35>>
<<HideAll>>
<<Fade "#000000" 0 1 0.35>>
<<wait 0.4>>
<<jump Hephaestus_Intro>>
===